"speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":1531752042,"text":"#Ah, {NICKNAME}. Didn't expect to see you here.","nextNodeIds":[745200402,745200403]},{"nodeId":745200402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4071315042,"text":"It's been a while, Eula.","nextNodeIds":[745200404]},{"nodeId":745200404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":865365170,"text":"A routine patrol, yeah. But as far as I'm concerned, this is a necessary activity that keeps me in fighting shape.","nextNodeIds":[745200405]},{"nodeId":745200405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":3020751554,"text":"Mondstadt's enjoyed relative peace lately, and there have hardly been any threats worth mustering the Reconnaissance Company for. As a result, everyone's been going a bit soft.","nextNodeIds":[745200406]},{"nodeId":745200406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4084480402,"text":"Work-life balance is a good thing, you know.","nextNodeIds":[745200407]},{"nodeId":745200407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":2365381354,"text":"You're not wrong, but as Squad Leader, I must keep my combat strength up at all times.","nextNodeIds":[745200408]},{"nodeId":745200408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":1703618434,"text":"After all, the swords of our enemies are not dulled by peace.","nextNodeIds":[745200409]},{"nodeId":745200409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":3322311818,"text":"As such, I'm used to finding quiet places to practice my swordsmanship between patrols to make sure I don't get rusty.","nextNodeIds":[745200410,745200411]},{"nodeId":745200410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4138357002,"text":"In that case, the time is nigh...","nextNodeIds":[745200412]},{"nodeId":745200412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":3119100386,"text":"Hmm? What an interesting request.","nextNodeIds":[745200413]},{"nodeId":745200413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":1972381642,"text":"Still, I move pretty fast. Are you sure your Kamera can keep up?","nextNodeIds":[745200414,745200415]},{"nodeId":745200414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1723673538,"text":"No need to change a thing!","nextNodeIds":[745200416]},{"nodeId":745200416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":425023978,"text":"Confidence — I like it. In that case, I'm going to go at full-tilt.","nextNodeIds":[745200417]},{"nodeId":745200417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30908,"speakerName":"Eula","textMapHash":2970518162,"text":"Watch closely now. The waves rise and fall in but an instant.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745200415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3660978946,"text":"I'll keep you in the frame, no problem!","nextNodeIds":[745200416]},{"nodeId":745200411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3832307970,"text":"Let me take a photo of you!","nextNodeIds":[745200412]},{"nodeId":745200403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":743029602,"text":"Are you on duty?","nextNodeIds":[745200404]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7452001"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCF